.Dt APP-DESIGN 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm app-design
.Nd desain dan pengembangan aplikasi database
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Ini catatan Chapter 9 dari buku Database System Concepts. Isinya:
arsitektur aplikasi, web fundamentals, servlets, JSP, PHP,
arsitektur 3-layer, RAD, performance, security, encryption.
.Pp
Bahasa santai. Tiap konsep dijelasin kenapa dia ada. Karena
topik ini jembatan antara database dan aplikasi beneran.
.Ss Bagian 1: Kenapa Perlu Application Program?
.Sy Kenyataan:
Kebanyakan user database
.Sy nggak
pakai SQL langsung. Mereka pakai aplikasi: m-banking, e-commerce,
media sosial.
.Pp
.Sy Aplikasi
jadi intermediary antara user dan database.
.Ss Bagian 1.1: Tiga Layer Aplikasi
.Bl -tag -width "Front-end" -offset indent
.It Sy Front-end
User interface. Bisa form, GUI, atau web-based.
.It Sy Middle layer
Business logic. Ngatur aturan, validasi, workflow.
.It Sy Backend
Database. Nyimpen data.
.El
.Ss Bagian 1.2: Evolusi Arsitektur Aplikasi
.Bl -tag -width "Web era" -offset indent
.It Sy Mainframe era (1960-70an)
Terminal \(-> mainframe computer. Proprietary network.
.It Sy PC era (1980an)
Desktop PC \(-> LAN \(-> database. Aplikasi di-install di tiap PC.
.It Sy Web era (1990an ke atas)
Browser \(-> internet \(-> web application server \(-> database.
Nggak perlu install.
.El
.Sy Kenapa web menang?
Karena browser jadi de-facto standard user interface. User bisa
akses dari mana aja, nggak perlu install specialized code.
Javascript, Flash, dan scripting lain jalan di browser,
di-download transparently.
.Ss Bagian 2: World Wide Web
.Sy Web
= distributed information system berbasis hypertext.
.Pp
.Sy HTML documents
berisi:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Text plus font specification.
.It
Hypertext link ke dokumen lain.
.It
Forms \(em user bisa masukin data.
.El
.Ss Bagian 2.1: URL
.Sy Uniform Resource Locator.
Contoh:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
http://www.acm.org/sigmod
.Ed
.Sy Struktur:
.Bl -enun -offset indent
.It
.Sy http:
\(em cara akses dokumen.
.It
.Sy www.acm.org
\(em nama unik machine di internet.
.It
.Sy /sigmod
\(em identifikasi dokumen di machine.
.El
.Sy Bisa juga:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
http://www.google.com/search?q=silberschatz
.Ed
Path ke program, plus argumen.
.Ss Bagian 2.2: HTML dan HTTP
.Sy HTML
provide:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Formatting.
.It
Hypertext link.
.It
Image display.
.It
Tables.
.It
Stylesheets.
.It
Input features: dropdown, radio button, checkbox, text box.
.El
.Sy HTTP
\(em HyperText Transfer Protocol \(em buat komunikasi dengan
web server.
.Ss Bagian 2.3: Web Server
.Sy Server bisa jadi front-end ke berbagai service.
.Pp
.Sy Dokumen di URL
bisa jadi executable program. Pas di-request, program jalan,
generate HTML, kirim balik ke client.
.Pp
.Sy Keuntungan:
Buat install service baru, tinggal bikin executable baru.
Browser provide GUI-nya.
.Pp
.Sy CGI
\(em Common Gateway Interface \(em standard interface antara
web server dan application server.
.Ss Bagian 3: Arsitektur Web
.Ss Bagian 3.1: Three-Layer Architecture
.Bd -literal -offset indent
Browser --HTTP--> Web server --> Application server --> Database server
.Ed
.Sy Kelebihan:
Modular. Tiap layer bisa di-scale terpisah.
.Sy Kekurangan:
Multiple levels of indirection have overheads.
.Ss Bagian 3.2: Two-Layer Architecture
.Bd -literal -offset indent
Browser --HTTP--> Web+Application server --> Database server
.Ed
.Sy Lebih simpel, lebih cepet. Tapi kurang modular.
.Ss Bagian 3.3: HTTP dan Session
.Sy HTTP itu connectionless.
Setelah server reply, connection ditutup, server lupa request.
.Pp
.Sy Beda dengan Unix login atau JDBC/ODBC
yang stay connected sampai client disconnect.
.Pp
.Sy Kenapa connectionless?
Reduce load on server. OS punya limit buat open connections.
.Pp
.Sy Masalah:
Information services butuh session info. Contoh: user
authentication cukup sekali per session.
.Pp
.Sy Solusinya:
Cookie.
.Ss Bagian 3.4: Cookie
.Sy Cookie
= small piece of text containing identifying information.
.Pp
.Sy Cara kerja:
.Bl -enun -offset indent
.It
Server kirim cookie ke browser di interaksi pertama.
.It
Browser kirim balik cookie itu ke server di interaksi
berikutnya.
.It
Server simpen info tentang cookie yang dia issue.
.El
.Sy Isi cookie:
Authentication info, user preferences.
.Sy Bisa permanent atau limited time.
.Ss Bagian 4: Servlets
.Sy Servlet
= Java API buat komunikasi antara web/application server dan
application program.
.Pp
.Sy Cara kerja:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Application program (servlet) di-load ke server.
.It
Tiap request spawn new thread.
.It
Thread ditutup setelah request selesai.
.El
.Ss Bagian 4.1: Contoh Servlet
.Bd -literal -offset indent
public class PersonQueryServlet extends HttpServlet {
    public void doGet(HttpServletRequest request,
                      HttpServletResponse response)
        throws ServletException, IOException
    {
        response.setContentType("text/html");
        PrintWriter out = response.getWriter();
        out.println("<HEAD><TITLE>Query Result</TITLE></HEAD>");
        out.println("<BODY>");

        String persontype = request.getParameter("persontype");
        String number = request.getParameter("name");

        if (persontype.equals("student")) {
            // code to find students with specified name
            // using JDBC to communicate with database
            out.println("<table BORDER COLS=3>");
            // ... loop results ...
        } else {
            // as above, but for instructors
        }
        out.println("</BODY>");
        out.close();
    }
}
.Ed
.Ss Bagian 4.2: Servlet Session
.Bd -literal -offset indent
if (request.getSession(false) == true) {
    // existing session
} else {
    // redirect to authentication page
}

request.getSession(true);  // creates new session

session.setAttribute("userid", userid);
session.getAttribute("userid");
.Ed
.Ss Bagian 4.3: Servlet Support
.Sy Application servers:
Apache Tomcat, Glassfish, JBoss, BEA Weblogic, IBM WebSphere,
Oracle Application Servers.
.Pp
.Sy Support:
Deployment, monitoring, J2EE platform.
.Ss Bagian 5: Server-Side Scripting
.Sy Ide:
Embed executable code atau SQL di HTML document. Pas document
di-request, server jalanin kode, generate HTML.
.Pp
.Sy Input dari HTML form
bisa langsung dipakai di embedded code.
.Pp
.Sy Bahasa:
JSP, PHP, VBScript, Perl, Python.
.Ss Bagian 5.1: JSP
.Bd -literal -offset indent
<html>
<head><title>Hello</title></head>
<body>
<% if (request.getParameter("name") == null) {
       out.println("Hello World");
   } else {
       out.println("Hello, " + request.getParameter("name"));
   }
%>
</body>
</html>
.Ed
.Sy JSP di-compile jadi Java + Servlet.
Bisa define new tags di tag library.
.Ss Bagian 5.2: PHP
.Bd -literal -offset indent
<html>
<head><title>Hello</title></head>
<body>
<?php
if (!isset($_REQUEST['name'])) {
    echo "Hello World";
} else {
    echo "Hello, " + $_REQUEST['name'];
}
?>
</body>
</html>
.Ed
.Sy PHP
widely used buat web scripting. Extensive library, termasuk
ODBC buat database access.
.Ss Bagian 5.3: Client-Side Scripting
.Sy Browser bisa fetch script dan jalanin di client site.
Contoh: Javascript, Flash, VRML, Applets.
.Pp
.Sy Kegunaan:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Animation.
.It
Validasi input user.
.It
Flexible interaction.
.It
Speed up interaction (nggak perlu round trip ke server).
.El
.Sy Security:
Butuh mekanisme biar malicious script nggak ngerusak client.
Java punya security system yang cegah applet akses system
call langsung.
.Ss Bagian 5.4: Javascript dan AJAX
.Sy Javascript
bisa:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Cek validitas input.
.It
Modify displayed page pakai DOM.
.It
Communicate dengan server buat fetch data tanpa reload
(AJAX).
.El
.Sy Contoh:
Pilih negara di dropdown, otomatis populate daftar provinsi
di dropdown kedua.
.Ss Bagian 6: Application Architecture
.Ss Bagian 6.1: Application Layers
.Bl -tag -width "Data access" -offset indent
.It Sy Presentation / user interface
Bisa pakai MVC (Model-View-Controller).
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
.Sy Model
\(em business logic.
.It
.Sy View
\(em presentation of data.
.It
.Sy Controller
\(em receive events, execute actions, return view.
.El
.It Sy Business logic
High-level view of data dan actions. Pakai object data model.
Hide detail schema.
.It Sy Data access
Interface antara business logic dan database. Mapping object
model ke relational model.
.El
.Ss Bagian 6.2: Business Logic
.Sy Provides abstractions
dari entities: student, instructor, course.
.Pp
.Sy Enforces business rules:
Contoh: student bisa enroll cuma kalau prereq udah selesai
dan tuition udah dibayar.
.Pp
.Sy Supports workflows:
Task yang involve multiple participants.
.Ss Bagian 6.3: Object-Relational Mapping
.Sy Ide:
Application code ditulis pakai object-oriented data model,
tapi data disimpen di relational database.
.Pp
.Sy Alternatif:
Implement object-oriented atau object-relational database.
Tapi belum commercially successful.
.Pp
.Sy Schema designer
harus provide mapping antara object data dan relational schema.
Contoh: Java class
.Sy Student
map ke relation
.Sy student .
.Ss Bagian 6.4: Hibernate
.Sy Hibernate
= object-relational mapping system yang widely used.
.Pp
.Sy Fitur:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Runs on variety of database systems.
.It
Support query language yang bisa express complex query
dengan join.
.It
Translate queries ke SQL.
.It
Allow relationships to be mapped to sets associated with
objects.
.El
.Ss Bagian 6.5: Entity Data Model (Microsoft)
.Sy Provides entity-relationship model
langsung ke application.
.Pp
.Sy Maps data
antara entity data model dan underlying storage.
.Pp
.Sy Entity SQL
operate langsung di Entity Data Model.
.Ss Bagian 6.6: Web Services
.Sy REST
\(em Representation State Transfer. Pakai standard HTTP request
ke URL. Return data in XML atau JSON.
.Pp
.Sy Big Web Services
\(em uses XML representation, standard protocol layer on top
of HTTP.
.Ss Bagian 6.7: Offline Web Apps
.Sy Tools
buat aplikasi yang bisa use the Web when connected, tapi
operate locally when disconnected.
.Pp
.Sy Contoh:
Google Gears browser plugin. Provide local database, local
web server, dan support execution JavaScript di client.
.Pp
.Sy Adobe AIR
provide similar functionality di luar browser.
.Ss Bagian 7: Rapid Application Development (RAD)
.Sy Masalah:
Developing web application interfaces butuh banyak effort.
Apalagi buat rich interaction Web 2.0.
.Pp
.Sy Solusi:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Function library buat generate UI elements.
.It
Drag-and-drop di IDE.
.It
Automatically generate code dari declarative spec.
.El
.Ss Bagian 7.1: Web App Frameworks
.Bl -tag -width "Rails" -offset indent
.It Sy Java Server Faces (JSF)
Include JSP tag library.
.It Sy Ruby on Rails
Easy creation of simple CRUD interfaces by code generation
from database schema.
.El
.Ss Bagian 7.2: ASP.NET dan Visual Studio
.Sy ASP.NET
provide berbagai controls yang interpreted di server, generate
HTML.
.Pp
.Sy Visual Studio
provide drag-and-drop development.
.Pp
.Sy Fitur:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Menu dan list box bisa diasosiasiin dengan DataSet.
.It
Validator controls buat form input.
.It
JavaScript buat enforce constraint di client, separately
enforced di server.
.It
DataGrid buat display SQL query result.
.El
.Ss Bagian 8: Application Performance
.Sy Masalah:
Popular web sites diakses jutaan user tiap hari, ribuan request
per detik di peak time.
.Pp
.Sy Solusi:
Caching.
.Bl -tag -width "Client-side" -offset indent
.It Sy Server-side
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Caching JDBC connections (connection pooling).
.It
Caching results of database queries.
.It
Caching generated HTML.
.El
.It Sy Client-side
Caching pages by web proxy.
.El
.Ss Bagian 9: Application Security
.Ss Bagian 9.1: SQL Injection
.Sy Contoh bug:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
"select * from instructor where name = " + name + ""
.Ed
.Sy Kalau user masukin:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
X' or 'Y' = 'Y
.Ed
.Sy Query jadi:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
select * from instructor
where name = 'X' or 'Y' = 'Y'
.Ed
.Sy Lebih parah:
User bisa masukin:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
X'; update instructor set salary = salary + 10000;
.Ed
.Sy Solusi:
Selalu pakai
.Sy prepared statement
dengan user input sebagai parameter.
.Ss Bagian 9.2: Cross-Site Scripting (XSS/XSRF)
.Sy Serangan:
HTML code di satu page jalanin action di page lain.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
<img src="http://mybank.com/transfermoney?amount=1000&toaccount=14523">
.Ed
.Sy Risiko:
Kalau user viewing page itu sementara login ke mybank,
transfernya bisa sukses.
.Ss Bagian 9.3: Proteksi dari XSS
.Bl -enun -offset indent
.It
Disallow HTML tags di text input user. Detect dan strip.
.It
Pakai referer value buat cek link dari page valid.
.It
Pastiin IP request sama dengan IP authentication.
.It
Never use GET method buat updates.
.El
.Ss Bagian 9.4: Password Leakage
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Never store password di clear text.
.It
Restrict access ke database server dari IP application servers.
.It
Source file backup (file.jsp~, .file.jsp.swp) bisa di-serve
kalau nggak hati-hati.
.El
.Ss Bagian 9.5: Authentication
.Bl -tag -width "Two-factor" -offset indent
.It Sy Single factor
Password aja. Terlalu risky untuk critical applications.
.It Sy Two-factor
Password plus one-time password dari SMS atau device.
.It Sy Man-in-the-middle attack
Website palsu yang pura-pura jadi mybank.com.
Solution: digital certificate plus secure HTTP.
.It Sy Central authentication
Application redirect ke central authentication service.
LDAP atau Active Directory.
.It Sy Single Sign-On (SSO)
User authenticated sekali, applications communicate dengan
authentication service buat verify identity.
.Sy SAML
\(em standard buat exchange authentication info.
.Sy OpenID
\(em share authentication across organizations.
.El
.Ss Bagian 10: Fine-Grained Authorization
.Sy Masalah:
SQL standard nggak allow fine-grained authorization seperti
"student bisa lihat grade sendiri, tapi nggak yang lain".
.Pp
.Sy Problem 1:
Database nggak tau siapa application user.
.Sy Problem 2:
SQL authorization at level table atau column, bukan row
spesifik.
.Pp
.Sy Workaround:
Pakai view.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
create view studentTakes as
select * from takes
where takes.ID = sys_context.user_id()
.Ed
.Sy Solution baru:
Oracle Virtual Private Database (VPD) \(em allow predicates
ditambahin transparently ke semua SQL query.
.Ss Bagian 10.1: Audit Trail
.Sy Aplikasi harus log actions
buat detect siapa yang update atau access sensitive data.
.Pp
.Sy Audit trail
digunakan after-the-fact buat:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Detect security breach.
.It
Repair damage.
.It
Trace who carried out breach.
.El
.Sy Level:
Database level dan application level.
.Ss Bagian 11: Enkripsi
.Ss Bagian 11.1: Prinsip
.Sy Data boleh di-encrypt
kalau database authorization nggak cukup.
.Pp
.Sy Properties:
.Bl -enun -offset indent
.It
Relatively simple buat authorized user encrypt/decrypt.
.It
Keamanan tergantung keamanan key, bukan algoritma.
.It
Extremely difficult buat intruder determine key.
.El
.Ss Bagian 11.2: Symmetric vs Public-Key
.Bl -tag -width "Public-key" -offset indent
.It Sy Symmetric
Same key buat encrypt dan decrypt. Contoh: DES, AES.
.It Sy Public-key (asymmetric)
Different keys. Encryption key public, decryption key secret.
Contoh: RSA.
.El
.Ss Bagian 11.3: Hybrid Schemes
.Sy Kombinasi
public key dan private key buat efisiensi.
.Pp
.Sy Masalah:
Encryption nilai kecil kayak identifier rentan dictionary
attacks.
.Pp
.Sy Solusi:
Tambah random bits di akhir nilai sebelum encryption, hapus
setelah decryption. Ini disebut
.Sy salt bits .
.Ss Bagian 11.4: Encryption in Databases
.Sy Level encryption:
.Bl -tag -width "Atribut" -offset indent
.It Sy Disk block
Tiap disk block di-encrypt pakai key di database-system
software.
.It Sy Entire relations atau attributes
Non-sensitive relations atau attributes nggak perlu.
Tapi attributes yang involved di primary/foreign key
constraints nggak bisa di-encrypt.
.El
.Ss Bagian 11.5: Challenge-Response
.Sy Menghindari transmission password.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
DB kirim challenge string random ke user
User encrypt string, return hasil
DB verifikasi dengan decrypt
.Ed
.Ss Bagian 11.6: Digital Signature
.Sy Verifikasi authenticity of data.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
Use private key (reverse) buat encrypt data
Siapa aja verify pakai public key (reverse) buat decrypt
.Ed
.Sy Nonrepudiation:
Sender nggak bisa claim nggak bikin data itu.
.Ss Bagian 11.7: Digital Certificate
.Sy Verify authenticity of public key.
.Pp
.Sy Cara kerja:
.Bl -enun -offset indent
.It
Tiap client punya public key dari root-level certification
authorities.
.It
Site bisa dapetin certificate dari authority.
.It
Client pakai public key authority buat verify certificate.
.El
.Sy Multiple levels
of certification authority bisa exist.
.Ss Ringkasan
.Bd -literal -offset indent
Konsep                Inti
Application layer     Front-end, middle, backend
Mainframe/PC/Web      Tiga era arsitektur
HTML                  Formatting + link + form
HTTP                  Protocol connectionless
URL                   Alamat resource
Cookie                Session info
Servlet               Java API buat web
JSP                   Java Server Pages
PHP                   Server-side scripting
Javascript            Client-side scripting
AJAX                  Async update tanpa reload
MVC                   Model-View-Controller
ORM                   Object-Relational Mapping
Hibernate             ORM populer
REST                  Web service via HTTP
RAD                   Rapid Application Development
Caching               Performance optimization
SQL injection         Serangan via string concat
XSS/XSRF              Cross-site scripting
Two-factor auth       Password + OTP
SSO                   Single Sign-On
SAML                  Auth exchange standard
Audit trail           Log actions
Symmetric encryption  Same key
Public-key            Different keys
Digital signature     Verify authenticity
Certificate           Verify public key
.Ed
Kalau kamu cuma inget satu hal dari catatan ini, inget ini:
.Sy aplikasi database itu bukan cuma "frontend + database".
Ada business logic layer, data access layer, security
concerns, performance concerns. Kalau kamu skip layer-layer
itu, aplikasi kamu bakal rapuh.
.Pp
Yang belum dijawab di sini: gimana caranya scale aplikasi
buat jutaan user? Kapan pakai microservices, kapan monolith?
Gimana caranya handle distributed transaction? Itu topik
lanjutan: distributed systems, microservices architecture.
